{
  "id": "sargas-compendium-manager",
  "title": "Compendium Manager",
  "description": "Shares one compendium library between two Pathfinder 2e worlds on the same Foundry installation. Enable it in both worlds and they see the same compendiums: nothing to sync, nothing to wait for. Content lives in the companion Shared Library module, which never updates, so updating this module cannot touch it. Designed for installations where only one world runs at a time.",
